{"4991240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Witch Cabin Cleanup", "steam_appid": 4991240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witch's Cabin Cleanup is a cozy organizing simulator about putting a cluttered witch's cabin back in order. Sort 5,313 curios across 6 rooms: the apothecary, the library, the greenhouse, the ritual chamber, the familiar's den, and more. All at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Witch's Cabin Organizing Simulator</strong><br>The cabin is a mess, and the magic only made it worse. Return everything to its proper shelf at your own pace, with no timers and no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/1366904ffae3f7139468e471e10e8caa.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=99 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/bf16f11daaedd7c8fa58e4f7bff1a412.poster.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/bf16f11daaedd7c8fa58e4f7bff1a412.webm?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/bf16f11daaedd7c8fa58e4f7bff1a412.mp4?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up each item: a potion vial, a loose spellbook, or a jar of moth wings, find the room and shelf it belongs on, and set it in place. Work through the cabin one shelf at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/202e9013da40b5672477689d890fef7f.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=99 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/7d93c172c2111150948d957ea2b29e99.poster.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/7d93c172c2111150948d957ea2b29e99.webm?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/7d93c172c2111150948d957ea2b29e99.mp4?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn upgrades as you play. Move faster, reach farther, and unlock a few small spells: a levitation charm, a banishing wand, that make tidying the cabin quicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/fc7942fb19277a6f8af7f8e7acd06eb7.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=99 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/004f03000ec200c92f380963643fe7ed.poster.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/004f03000ec200c92f380963643fe7ed.webm?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/004f03000ec200c92f380963643fe7ed.mp4?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cluttered shelves fill with neat rows of labelled jars, and the tangled herb rack settles into order. Each finished room shows clear progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort more than 5,300 curios across 6 rooms of a witch's cabin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay: pick things up and put them back where they belong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill upgrades for speed and reach, plus a few magical abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limits and no game over. A relaxed pace you set yourself</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witch's Cabin Cleanup is a cozy organizing simulator about putting a cluttered witch's cabin back in order. Sort 5,313 curios across 6 rooms: the apothecary, the library, the greenhouse, the ritual chamber, the familiar's den, and more. All at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Witch's Cabin Organizing Simulator</strong><br>The cabin is a mess, and the magic only made it worse. Return everything to its proper shelf at your own pace, with no timers and no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/1366904ffae3f7139468e471e10e8caa.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=99 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/bf16f11daaedd7c8fa58e4f7bff1a412.poster.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/bf16f11daaedd7c8fa58e4f7bff1a412.webm?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/bf16f11daaedd7c8fa58e4f7bff1a412.mp4?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up each item: a potion vial, a loose spellbook, or a jar of moth wings, find the room and shelf it belongs on, and set it in place. Work through the cabin one shelf at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/202e9013da40b5672477689d890fef7f.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=99 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/7d93c172c2111150948d957ea2b29e99.poster.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/7d93c172c2111150948d957ea2b29e99.webm?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/7d93c172c2111150948d957ea2b29e99.mp4?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn upgrades as you play. Move faster, reach farther, and unlock a few small spells: a levitation charm, a banishing wand, that make tidying the cabin quicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/fc7942fb19277a6f8af7f8e7acd06eb7.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=99 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/004f03000ec200c92f380963643fe7ed.poster.avif?t=1787737979\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/004f03000ec200c92f380963643fe7ed.webm?t=1787737979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://